@startuml code-cpg-construction
' Three-pass CPG build over one AST: build_from_ast -> build_cfg -> build_dfg into a petgraph DiGraph.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/code-cpg-construction.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 2 in docs/components/code/cpg.md
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam activity {
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
}
title Code Property Graph — Three Construction Passes

start
:ParsedCode.root() ▷ AstNode::from_ts_node;
partition "Pass 1 — build_from_ast  (syntax)" {
  :classify_ast_node(kind) ▷ CpgNodeKind; <<#EF6C00>>
  :add CpgNode · AstChild edge to parent
· AstSibling edge between children; <<#EF6C00>>
  :record Variable / Parameter names
into variable_defs; <<#EF6C00>>
}
partition "Pass 2 — build_cfg  (control flow)" {
  :Function ▷ entry_node; <<#EF6C00>>
  :Return ▷ exit_nodes; <<#EF6C00>>
  :Branch ▷ CfgTrue / CfgFalse edges; <<#EF6C00>>
  :Loop ▷ CfgTrue(body) · CfgBack · CfgFalse(exit); <<#EF6C00>>
}
partition "Pass 3 — build_dfg  (data flow)" {
  :Assignment ▷ DfgWrite(lhs) · DfgRead(rhs); <<#EF6C00>>
  :Variable use ▷ DfgFlow from each def; <<#EF6C00>>
}
:**CodePropertyGraph**
petgraph DiGraph<CpgNode, CpgEdge>
+ location_map + variable_defs; <<#00838F>>
:queries ▷ cfg_successors · data_flow_for_variable
· find_by_kind · compute_depths;
stop

legend bottom
  |= Edge family |= CpgEdgeKind |
  | AST | AstChild · AstSibling |
  | CFG | CfgNext · CfgTrue · CfgFalse · CfgBack · CfgException |
  | DFG | DfgRead · DfgWrite · DfgFlow · DfgDepends |
  | Call / Type | Calls · Argument · Returns · HasType · Inherits |
endlegend

@enduml
